# Round 18, C2-2. E §4.2 step 0: "Each opening reading at t start that the cut sees, with t before K, anchors its place";
# L §5.10: an anchor reading at or before a place's first read; L §5.19: "Like an observation, a reading applies only
# before the cut K". konto lives from before S with its first reading an opening at 2026-03-01 start: February is
# HOLE-ANCHOR `<place> has no balance before <d>`, d its first reading's instant (L §8.1); March is 500.00 + 10.00 booked
# since = 510.00 PLN (follows: snap11 the same). The opening at 2026-08-01 start is after K (2026-06-30), so it is not
# applied: August is 510.00 PLN (fixed: snap11 applied it, 900.00 PLN).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input day: date

move p: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-02-28), bal(konto, 2026-03-31), bal(konto, 2026-08-31)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  day = 2026-03-10
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start
  opening[konto] = 900.00 PLN at 2026-08-01 start
=== expect
q: (?"konto has no balance before 2026-03-01" (konto), 510.00 PLN, 510.00 PLN)
  unfulfilled: p
  cut 2026-06-30
